{"id": "2ba40d23-3836-4191-a192-7a044376c317", "slug": "futuristic-dashboard-interface", "title": "Futuristic Dashboard Interface", "description": "Futuristic Interface Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Futuristic Dashboard Interface\"\ndescription: \"Futuristic Interface Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#2DD4BF\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#3B82F6\"\n  background: \"#030508\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Futuristic Dashboard Interface\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 34; favorites: 11; remixes: 2.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, bento, charts, security, navigation.\n## Overview\nFuturistic Interface Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nYOUOR Dashboard Explore Settings Latest Projects Updated 2h ago View All Our Services Processing High-performance computational infrastructure. Active Security Enterprise-grade encryption and monitoring. Setup Storage D…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Latest Projects; Our Services; Processing; Security; Storage; Contact Us.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #2DD4BF, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #3B82F6, background #030508, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Futuristic Dashboard Interface</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r134/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: { sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'] },\n                    colors: {\n                        surface: 'rgba(10, 12, 16, 0.6)',\n                        surfaceLight: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03)',\n                        accent: '#2DD4BF', // Cyan/Teal accent\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030508] text-slate-300 font-sans overflow-hidden w-screen h-screen selection:bg-accent/30 selection:text-white\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Container -->\n    <div id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-70 mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Viewport Scaling Container -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center p-4\" style=\"perspective: 1200px;\">\n\n        <!-- Scaled Wrapper to ensure everything fits in viewport while maintaining complex layout -->\n        <div id=\"composition-wrapper\" class=\"relative w-[1400px] h-[900px] transform-gpu origin-center\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\n\n            <!-- Center Hero Card -->\n            <div class=\"glass-panel absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[720px] z-30 rounded-3xl backdrop-blur-2xl bg-surface border border-white/[0.06] flex flex-col overflow-hidden\"\n                 style=\"box-shadow: 0 40px 100px -20px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1); transform: translate3d(-50%, -50%, 40px);\">\n\n                <!-- Header -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-8 py-5 border-b border-white/[0.04]\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-white\">\n                        <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-accent to-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-base font-medium tracking-tight\">YOUOR</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 text-xs font-medium text-white/50\">\n                        <button class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Dashboard</button>\n                        <button class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent/10 text-accent border border-accent/20\">Explore</button>\n                        <button class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Settings</button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Main Image Area -->\n                <div class=\"p-8 pb-10 flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent to-surface/80 z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/5ee0a38a-b5d3-4531-8793-98beed4af162_1600w.jpg\"\n                         alt=\"Abstract 3D Shape\"\n                         class=\"w-full h-[380px] object-cover rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.04]\"\n                         style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Latest Projects Card (Top Right) -->\n            <div class=\"glass-panel absolute right-[60px] top-[80px] w-[460px] z-20 rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-xl bg-surface border border-white/[0.06] p-6 flex flex-col gap-5\"\n                 style=\"box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -15px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.08); transform: translate3d(0, 0, 10px) rotateY(-5deg) rotateX(2deg);\">\n\n                <h2 class=\"text-lg text-white font-medium tracking-tight flex items-center justify-between\">\n                    Latest Projects\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-circle-linear\" class=\"text-white/40 text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                </h2>\n\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n                    <!-- Project Item -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 items-center group cursor-pointer\">\n                        <div class=\"w-full aspect-square rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/[0.05] relative\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div>\n                            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/724142aa-44a6-48d3-9cf3-761e00d05b78_1600w.jpg\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-16 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/[0.08]\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Project Item -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 items-center group cursor-pointer\">\n                        <div class=\"w-full aspect-square rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/[0.05] relative\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div>\n                            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/e534354d-c5f2-4399-a1d9-2f50338e8c47_1600w.jpg\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent/40\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Project Item -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 items-center group cursor-pointer\">\n                        <div class=\"w-full aspect-square rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/[0.05] relative\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div>\n                            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/bfef5098-c30f-4cd9-b4ac-04b2673ab943_1600w.jpg\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-20 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/[0.08]\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"w-full h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/[0.08] to-transparent mt-2\"></div>\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center px-2\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-white/40\">Updated 2h ago</span>\n                    <button class=\"text-xs text-accent hover:text-white transition-colors\">View All</button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Our Services Card (Bottom Left) -->\n            <div class=\"glass-panel absolute left-[40px] bottom-[60px] w-[620px] z-25 rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-xl bg-surface border border-white/[0.06] p-7\"\n                 style=\"box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -15px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.08); transform: translate3d(0, 0, 20px) rotateY(3deg) rotateX(-2deg);\">\n\n                <h2 class=\"text-xl text-white font-medium tracking-tight mb-6\">Our Services</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n                    <!-- Service 1 -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-surfaceLight border border-white/[0.04] rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 hover:bg-white/[0.05] transition-colors cursor-pointer group\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-bolt-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-accent\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-sm text-white font-medium\">Processing</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-white/40 leading-relaxed\">High-performance computational infrastructure.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-auto pt-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-accent flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-white/60\">Active</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Service 2 -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-surfaceLight border border-white/[0.04] rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 hover:bg-white/[0.05] transition-colors cursor-pointer group\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-keyhole-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-white/70 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-sm text-white font-medium\">Security</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-white/40 leading-relaxed\">Enterprise-grade encryption and monitoring.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-auto pt-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:border-white/40 transition-colors\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-white/40\">Setup</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Service 3 -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-surfaceLight border border-white/[0.04] rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 hover:bg-white/[0.05] transition-colors cursor-pointer group\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-white/70 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-sm text-white font-medium\">Storage</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-white/40 leading-relaxed\">Distributed and redundant data lakes.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-auto pt-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:border-white/40 transition-colors\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-white/40\">Setup</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Contact Us Card (Bottom Right) -->\n            <div class=\"glass-panel absolute right-[90px] bottom-[100px] w-[340px] z-10 rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-xl bg-surface border border-white/[0.06] p-7 flex flex-col gap-5\"\n                 style=\"box-shadow: 0 20px 50px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.08); transform: translate3d(0, 0, -10px) rotateY(-8deg);\">\n\n                <h2 class=\"text-lg text-white font-medium tracking-tight\">Contact Us</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-white/40 leading-relaxed\">Reach out to our systems team for priority deployment access.</p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 mt-2\">\n                    <div class=\"relative\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:letter-linear\" class=\"absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-white/30 text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Enter your email address\"\n                               class=\"w-full bg-black/20 border border-white/[0.08] rounded-lg py-2.5 pl-10 pr-4 text-xs text-white placeholder:text-white/30 focus:outline-none focus:border-accent/50 focus:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\">\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                        <button class=\"flex-1 bg-accent hover:bg-accent/90 text-black text-xs font-medium py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors\">\n                            Send Request\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-white/[0.08] text-xs text-white/60 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\">\n                            Docs\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Decorative Floating Elements based on reference -->\n            <div class=\"glass-panel absolute left-[120px] top-[140px] w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-accent/30 bg-accent/5 flex items-center justify-center z-10 backdrop-blur-md\"\n                 style=\"transform: translate3d(0,0,-20px);\">\n                <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent animate-pulse\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"glass-panel absolute right-[250px] bottom-[20px] w-24 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-accent/50 to-transparent z-10\"\n                 style=\"transform: rotate(-45deg);\"></div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // 1. Responsive Scaling Logic (Ensures UI fits in viewport perfectly)\n        function resizeLayout() {\n            const wrapper = document.getElementById('composition-wrapper');\n            const targetWidth = 1400;\n            const targetHeight = 900;\n\n            const windowWidth = window.innerWidth;\n            const windowHeight = window.innerHeight;\n\n            // Calculate scale to fit within viewport with a little padding (95%)\n            const scaleX = windowWidth / targetWidth;\n            const scaleY = windowHeight / targetHeight;\n            const scale = Math.min(scaleX, scaleY) * 0.95;\n\n            wrapper.style.transform = `scale(${scale})`;\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resizeLayout);\n        resizeLayout();\n\n        // 2. WebGL Background Animation (Three.js)\n        function initWebGL() {\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Create a particle wave geometry\n            const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const count = 3000;\n            const positions = new Float32Array(count * 3);\n            const colors = new Float32Array(count * 3);\n\n            const color1 = new THREE.Color('#2DD4BF'); // Accent Cyan\n            const color2 = new THREE.Color('#3B82F6'); // Blue\n            const color3 = new THREE.Color('#8B5CF6'); // Purple\n\n            for(let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n                const i3 = i * 3;\n                // Scatter points in a wide plane\n                positions[i3] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 20; // x\n                positions[i3+1] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 10; // y\n                positions[i3+2] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 10; // z\n\n                // Mix colors randomly\n                const mixedColor = color1.clone().lerp(\n                    Math.random() > 0.5 ? color2 : color3,\n                    Math.random()\n                );\n\n                colors[i3] = mixedColor.r;\n                colors[i3+1] = mixedColor.g;\n                colors[i3+2] = mixedColor.b;\n            }\n\n            geometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(positions, 3));\n            geometry.setAttribute('color', new THREE.BufferAttribute(colors, 3));\n\n            // Custom shader material for soft glowing points\n            const material = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                size: 0.05,\n                vertexColors: true,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.6,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending,\n                sizeAttenuation: true\n            });\n\n            const particles = new THREE.Points(geometry, material);\n            scene.add(particles);\n\n            camera.position.z = 5;\n            camera.position.y = 1;\n            camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            let clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            function animate() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Animate points forming a slow wave\n                const positions = particles.geometry.attributes.position.array;\n                for(let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n                    const i3 = i * 3;\n                    const x = positions[i3];\n                    const z = positions[i3+2];\n                    // Gentle sine wave motion\n                    positions[i3+1] = Math.sin(elapsedTime * 0.5 + x) * 0.5 + Math.cos(elapsedTime * 0.3 + z) * 0.5;\n                }\n                particles.geometry.attributes.position.needsUpdate = true;\n\n                // Slowly rotate entire system\n                particles.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.05;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            }\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle WebGL Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        }\n\n        // Initialize WebGL after a slight delay to ensure DOM is ready\n        setTimeout(initWebGL, 100);\n\n        // 3. GSAP Animations for UI Elements\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            // Entrance Animation\n            gsap.from(\".glass-panel\", {\n                y: 60,\n                opacity: 0,\n                rotationX: 5,\n                duration: 1.5,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            // Subtle Ambient Floating (Simulating depth without breaking layout)\n            const panels = document.querySelectorAll('.glass-panel');\n\n            panels.forEach((panel, index) => {\n                // Generate random subtle movements\n                const randomY = Math.random() * 15 + 10; // 10-25px movement\n                const randomDuration = Math.random() * 2 + 4; // 4-6s duration\n\n                // Extract current transform string to preserve base 3D positioning\n                const currentTransform = panel.style.transform || \"\";\n\n                // We wrap the panel's content in a GSAP animation rather than overwriting the base transform\n                // which handles the layout. Actually, animating CSS vars or a wrapper is cleaner,\n                // but for inline ease, we animate an internal property or just y offset.\n                gsap.to(panel, {\n                    y: `+=${randomY}`,\n                    duration: randomDuration,\n                    yoyo: true,\n                    repeat: -1,\n                    ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                    delay: index * 0.2\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Ambient background movement for the wrapper based on mouse position\n            const wrapper = document.getElementById('composition-wrapper');\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const x = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5) * 20; // max 20deg rotation\n                const y = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5) * 20;\n\n                gsap.to(wrapper, {\n                    rotationY: x,\n                    rotationX: -y,\n                    duration: 2,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\"\n                });\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "futuristic-dashboard-interface.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/futuristic-dashboard-interface.jpg", "source_name": "futuristic-dashboard-interface-DESIGN.md", "views": 246, "forks": 9, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "1a62ed4c-6d0d-4900-8de2-1f3139579949", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T23:13:24.388751+00:00"}